  "about": {
    "title": "About the Generations set",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Pokémon TCG: Generations is an XY expansion released on 22 February 2016. It has 117 cards: 83 in the main set, 2 alternate versions and 32 Radiant Collection cards. There are also 70 reverse holos.",
      "Choose what you’re collecting: the <b>Standard set</b> (the 83 main set cards), the <b>Master set</b> (153 cards, adding the reverse holos) or the <b>Grand Master set</b> (all 187 cards, adding the 2 alternate versions and 32 Radiant Collection cards).",
      "This free checklist lets you tick off the cards you own, count spare copies for trading, see your progress by rarity and plan your binder pages. It works on phones and computers, even offline, and your collection stays on your device."
    ]
